From: aquarat <blue@aquarat.co.uk>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:36:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] avformat/mpegts: merge the H.264 MVC dependent view PID
 into its base view stream

Blu-ray 3D and AVCHD 3D carry the MVC dependent view on its own PID (stream
type 0x20), but the decoder needs both view components of an access unit in
one packet. Assemble whole PES packets of both PIDs, match them by timestamp
and interleave their access units (two per PES packet for field coded
streams, delimited by AUDs and type 24 delimiters) into packets of the base
view stream. The dependent view PID no longer gets a stream of its own.

Enabled by default; disable with -merge_mvc 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012sK2py5V81UwVc4ofRaMXC
